<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Certifiable Safe RLHF: Fixed-Penalty Constraint Optimization for Safer Language Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Kartik Pandit<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup">†*</sup>
