</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname"><math id="m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\#" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>#</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\#</annotation></semantics></math> Department of Computer Engineering
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
