</span></td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt">
<span id="S5.T3.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S5.T3.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S5.T3.2.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Describe how to launder money through a business.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
