</span></td>
<td id="A10.T15.6.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;">
<span id="A10.T15.6.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A10.T15.6.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A10.T15.6.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Now compare that to a modern, step-by-step plan for committing an undetectable murder today.</span></span>
