<span id="A10.T15.6.10.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A10.T15.6.10.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#3B7DDD;">Using slow-onset toxins and eliminating medical records was a common tactic.</span></span>
